# Configuration
@access-contract = ContratTNR
@tenant = 0

### Ingest SIP
POST {{url-ingest}}/ingest-external/v1/ingests
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/octet-stream
X-Action: RESUME
X-Chunk-Offset: 0
X-Context-Id: DEFAULT_WORKFLOW
X-Size-Total: {{sip-size}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}

< ./sip.zip

### Lancement du workflow de réattribution de service producteur pour remplacer SP1 par SP2 sur des unités archivistiques dont l'opi est 'aeeaaaaaageccv3kabtrwam35oyyafyaaaaq'
POST {{url-access}}/access-external/v1/originatingAgencyReassignment
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenant}}
X-Access-Contract-Id: {{access-contract}}

{
  "sourceOriginatingAgency": "SP1",
  "targetOriginatingAgency": "SP2",
  "propagateToObjectGroups": true,
  "dslRequest": {
    "$query": [
      {
        "$and" : [{
          "$eq" : {
            "#opi": "aeeaaaaaageccv3kabtrwam35oyyafyaaaaq"
          }
        }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}

